# without one), ``running`` whether it is the plan running, ``checksum`` (``plan_reference.base.plan_checksum``; equal checksums
# are the same plan), ``maneuvers`` the stored manoeuvre objects with every field (in the order stored), ``transitions`` the
# (source id, destination id) pairs and ``start_maneuver_id`` as stored. The manoeuvres are copies: a client that edits them
# changes nothing stored. ``stored`` is always true: a ``QueryPlan`` of a plan that is not stored is refused (``OrderReply`` with
# the reason). ``order_id`` the id of the order it answers (0: none, e.g. a scripted one).
